17: **Try to break every stated guarantee.** For each claim of the form "exactly zero", "cannot happen", "by construction", "strictly dominates", "recoverable", "no free parameter": construct an instance that would VIOLATE it and run that instance. A guarantee you did not try to break is a guarantee you did not check.
